# Node.js Backend Bootcamp 🚀

Welcome to my **7-Day Node.js Backend Bootcamp** repository.

This repository documents my journey of learning backend development using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB**. The goal is to become internship-ready by building real-world backend projects and strengthening backend development concepts.

---

## 🎯 Goals

- Learn JavaScript for Backend
- Understand Node.js fundamentals
- Build REST APIs using Express.js
- Work with MongoDB using Mongoose
- Implement Authentication using JWT
- Learn Error Handling and Validation
- Build a Production-Ready Backend Project
- Deploy the project

---

